    {
     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: organising a project",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "做「理论与论证」相关的项目时，你觉得应该先准备什么？",
       "alumno": "On a project about «theories and arguments», what is best to prepare first?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我查了几份材料，发现不同来源的说法并不完全一样。",
       "alumno": "I have looked at several materials and found that the sources don't entirely agree.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "你打算怎样核实？",
       "alumno": "How do you plan to check it?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我会先比较出处，再看论据是否一致。",
       "alumno": "I'll first compare the sources, and then see whether the arguments match.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "如果核实后仍有差异呢？",
       "alumno": "What if the differences remain after checking?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "那就说明不同观点，并把证据的局限写清楚。",
       "alumno": "Then I will set out the different views and make clear the limits of the evidence.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: organising a project",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "研究「理论与论证」时，先提出清楚的问题，再选择资料和方法。",
       "alumno": "To study «theories and arguments», first you need to pose a clear question, and then choose sources and methods.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "比较不同材料之后，结论才有充分的依据。",
       "alumno": "Comparing different materials allows the conclusions to be better grounded.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果只凭个人印象，容易忽略其他情况；因此要核对材料，并说明判断依据。",
       "alumno": "If you rely only on personal impressions, you may overlook other cases; that's why you should check the materials and explain the basis for your judgement.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "组织短文时，可以先提出观点，再用事实或例子支持它。",
       "alumno": "When organising a short text, you can first put forward a view and then support it with facts or examples.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
